1
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:04,150
Getter Team! Are you all right?

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,500
I've come to help, for what it's worth!

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,650
Launch!

4
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:10,250
Akane! Tsubaki! Kaede!

5
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,900
Reinforcements from Dr. Tachibana?!

6
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:15,000
Then that machine is...!

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,800
The ladies of the Getter Team are here!

8
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,150
You can stop worrying now!

9
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,900
The name's Zan! Getter Zan!

10
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,800
Introductions can wait!

11
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,000
Let's go!
